:1419821900,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDE5ODIxOTAw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels/priority/medium","name":"priority/medium","color":"ffdc5e","default":false,"description":"Medium priority issue"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"tvesely","id":18601507,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjAxNTA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18601507?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely","html_url":"https://github.com/tvesely","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"tvesely","id":18601507,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjAxNTA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18601507?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely","html_url":"https://github.com/tvesely","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2023-06-23T16:53:15Z","updated_at":"2023-06-30T20:47:11Z","closed_at":"2023-06-30T20:47:10Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-6994](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-6994)\r\n### Description\r\n\r\nThe column data serialized in YSQL wire format consists of 2 parts, `PgWireDataHeader` and the data. `PgTableRow::SetValue` currently skips this header for fixed length datums , but does not skip the header when pointing to a variable length datum.\r\n\r\nAn example:\r\n\r\n```\r\n(gdb) p value\r\n$2 = (const yb::dockv::PgValue &) @0x7ffee097f6a0: {value_ = 24282667259112}\r\n(gdb) xxd value.value_ 20\r\nffffffffbfc194e8: 0000 0000 0000 0000 0972 656c 6174 696f  .........relatio\r\nffffffffbfc194f8: 6e00 0000                                n...\r\n```\r\n\r\nIn a variable length datum the `PgWireDataHeader` is encoded as the first byte to the buffer, followed by a wire encoded `uint64_t` to specify the length of the datum. Here you can see that the length (9 bytes) is 9 bytes after the start of the `PgValue`. In order to align to the wire encoded `uint64_t`, the `PgValue should point to 0xffffffffbfc194e9.\r\n\r\n```\r\n(gdb) xxd value.value_ 9\r\nffffffffbfc194e8: 0000 0000 0000 0000 09                   .........\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\n(gdb) xxd value.value_+9 9\r\nffffffffbfc194f1: 7265 6c61 7469 6f6e 00                   relation.\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\r\n\r\n- [X] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\r\n\r\n[DB-6994]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-6994?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"tvesely","id":18601507,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NjAxNTA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18601507?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely","html_url":"https://github.com/tvesely","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tvesely/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/17915/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/17915/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}